;    0: TWdCondition(count=1573, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=1421, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\3回ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Excuse me."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\エリカの部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "2" "2000" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Ah, </STYLE>Erika-san<STYLE ID="1">. Sorry for calling you so late."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Not at all... 
{PAUSE ""}
But this is unusual, isn't it? You being up at such an hour."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I've had a lot on my mind."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Mother..."<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Erica.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Now, don't make such a gloomy face."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"But... Mother, this year you..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes, I turned 75. It'll be soon now, I expect."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Erika-san<STYLE ID="1">, I want </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> to succeed me as Grand Witch. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Considering family line and age, there's no one but </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"No particular ritual is needed to become Grand Witch, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">there are a few things I want you to remember. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You aren't allowed to write them down, though, so make absolutely sure you don't forget them until you hand them on to the next one."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I will keep that in mind."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"One: you must not stop anyone who is trying to kill themselves."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Erika-san<STYLE ID="1">, this matter runs deep, you see. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Those who try to die have reason enough for it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
You<STYLE ID="1"> need only keep that in mind. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Understood?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Then, Mother, do you know what that reason is?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>You<STYLE ID="1"> needn't go that far. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">This is... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">the wicked side of this Arata settlement. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">And I have to bring it to an end with my generation."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Now, the next one. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">'The dead come forth from </STYLE><STYLE ID="2" RUBY="よみ">the underworld</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, and uncanny bewitching flowers rise in rows. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Those who have become corpses also become bewitching flowers and come forth from the underworld. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Only </STYLE><STYLE ID="3" RUBY="すいがん">the green-eyed</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> prevail. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Those who have become green-eyed wither the bewitching flowers and return the dead to the underworld. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The descendants shall without fail don masks and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4" RUBY="ちいろ">blood-red</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> garb, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="5" RUBY="あらが">resist</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">.'"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What is that...?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\アイテム\妖花の図.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"It's written in here, but I don't really understand it myself. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Still, every Grand Witch has been told to be sure to memorize it. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'm entrusting this to </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Understood..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"And the last one. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">'The shinigami are the four </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="しんし">divine messengers</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> who serve Abaddon. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Abaddon appears from a volcano of </STYLE><STYLE ID="7" RUBY="いおう">sulfur</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">What the Grand Witch must do―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">is to keep Abaddon and the four divine messengers sealed away.' </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Well, I don't know what this one is talking about either. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">There's no note of it written down anywhere, so be sure to memorize it and pass it on to the next generation."</STYLE><PG>
"'The shinigami are the four <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="しんし">divine messengers</STYLE> who serve Abaddon. 
{PAUSE ""}
Abaddon appears from a volcano of <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="いおう">sulfur</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
What the Grand Witch must do―
{PAUSE ""}
is to keep Abaddon and the four divine messengers sealed away.'"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Heh, </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1">'re quick to memorize things. That's a great help. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">That concludes the Grand Witch handover. I'll announce it to everyone in the settlement tomorrow."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes... 
{PAUSE ""}
Um, Mother..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Do you really want to kill yourself after all?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Erika-san<STYLE ID="1">, you don't need to know that."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"If I remember correctly, <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="ききょう">Kikyo</STYLE>-san, the Grand Witch two generations back, was―"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"You don't need to know."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Forgive me."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Right, well, I'll turn in now. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Oh, yes, that's right. Did you bring the thing I asked for?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ah, yes, here it is."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\アイテム\ビデオテープ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Heh heh heh... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
You<STYLE ID="1">'ve already watched it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes, I took the liberty of watching it first."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"So, how was it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It was so cute!
{PAUSE ""}
　Especially the scene where she transforms from her little form into a grown woman!
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Bad_Luck.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
　The direction and the sound effects, all the latest animation techniques packed in, every bit of it is perfect!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hmm, I think I'll watch this before bed after all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
Erika-san<STYLE ID="1">, will you watch it with me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Y-yes! It's really, truly the best!
{PAUSE ""}
　You introduced me to this path, Mother, and it changed my life!"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Though I never thought you'd get even more hooked than me..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Next I'm thinking of making the heroine's costume!
{PAUSE ""}
　And then I'll wear it... 
{PAUSE ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
'Warrior of love, Infinity Love!
{PLAYSND "SE\棒を振る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
　Now, I'll wrap the whole world in love!' 
{PLAYSND "SE\きらーん.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
That's what I want to do!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Now now, </STYLE>Erika-san<STYLE ID="1">! No spoiling the lines!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ah, I'm sorry!"<BR>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
